{"operations":[{"content":"# Membership summary\n\nMembers must provide a notice period of forty-five (45) days when terminating their membership, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-1957561bda937d6550d683d094ce58e05b272019 \"The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received.\"]].\n\nThe expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense, effective from 1 October 2026 [[cite:obs-b4777632a1f03211ababcf4497daca313e5708d5 \"With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"0268b0bec2307479021852e9fa4468a841c899c151531ca17806e527d658b8f6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the required statements about the notice period and expense approval threshold with exact citations from the provided sources."}